# Model weights are NEVER committed. They are fetched by tools/fetch_models.py from URLs
# pinned to an immutable upstream revision and verified against the sha256 digests in
# pack/models.lock.toml.
#
# Committing them would put ~410 MiB of binaries with their own licences into every clone
# of the base repository — the exact thing on-demand Capability Packs exist to avoid.
*
!.gitignore
